          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũngama yu wĩ na mowe maku, na mooi maku maingĩ, ala wathĩnĩe kuma wana waku; ethĩwa nũtonya kwĩuna, ethĩwa nũtonya kũkĩlya vinya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũnoetwe nĩ motao maku maingĩ: na yu ala mathanaa na ndata, o ala masiasya ndata, ala mathanaa kĩla mwei, nĩmaũngame, makũtangĩĩe kuma maũndũnĩ ala meũka kwaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
