          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maũndũ ala watethisye makeethĩwa mailyĩ ũu kwaku: ala matandĩthasya naku kuma wana waku makanyaĩĩka kĩla ũmwe na nzĩa yake; vatikethĩwa ũmwe wa ũkũtangĩĩa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
